description = "The known world lies along the eastern coast of a vast continent, bounded by the Sea of Stars to the east and the World Seam Mountains to the west. Beyond those mountains lie mysterious lands that remain entirely unknown.

To the south and southeast lie the Isilian Grasslands and the Kharak Desert, home to gnolls and numerous other beast-folk and wild-folk adapted to the hot climate. To the north and northeast stretches the Wild North, inhabited by goblins, orks, ogres, and other hostile peoples."
